# Baseline import

The initial baseline was captured read-only from the live services on 2026-09-18 UTC.

| Service | Live target | Captured |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ElevenLabs | Caroline / Main | Agent config, 11 branches, 47 tools, 5 knowledge documents, 9 procedures, 145 tests |
| Supabase | Caroline / `drsyygxqwxuyoyjbsaqs` | Database catalog, migration history, extensions, generated types, 28 Edge Functions |

Production remains authoritative until a later, explicit cutover decision. This repository contains configuration and source artifacts, not a backup of runtime data.
